      },
      "text":"Because each sandbox holds a real checkout, agents search it with grep and standard file tools instead of relying on broad semantic searches.\n\nOn an internal benchmark of 150 financial-document questions, this reached 0.627 answer accuracy versus about 0.37 for semantic search. https://t.co/w1nmA0N8yz"
    },
