      "id":"2109707032869982357",
      "public_metrics":{
        "bookmark_count":2,
        "impression_count":5842,
        "like_count":9,
        "quote_count":0,
        "reply_count":1,
        "retweet_count":1
      },
      "text":"A single long-lived sandbox per project would need provisioning for peak load and months of uptime.\n\nInstead, repositories live on S3-backed storage and each agent runs in its own ephemeral sandbox, so a crash loses only unsubmitted work. https://t.co/dglC3ZI6AX"
    },
    {
      "author_id":"1599587232175849472",
      "conversation_id":"2109706972723609733",
      "created_at":"2026-10-12T18:05:23.000Z",
