      "text":"This is how we built the filesystem behind Perplexity Projects as a Git forge for agents.\n\nEach agent works in its own sandbox and commits to a shared repository where people and other agents can build on its work across sessions.\n\nRead more: https://t.co/jcrTptb2IW https://t.co/dXnhroO4mg"
